## Building access
You need your keycard to enter **or exit** the building. If you are locked out after hours, you can call the university police (or pop out of a window). Email Aura Victoria Wilson to request keycard access to 108 and 109. Be sure to lock the room if you are the last one out to prevent theft.

## Printing
I was able to set up [MobilityPrint](https://www.uio.no/english/services/it/printing/help/print-from-a-private-pc-mac.html) following that link. Worked pretty seamlessly!

